
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Nexora Product Manual</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Access the official Nexora product manual, setup guide, and operating instructions.">

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #080b12;
      --panel: #111722;
      --text: #f5f7fb;
      --muted: #9ba8ba;
      --accent: #65e6c0;
      --border: #273244;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1100px, 90%);
      margin: auto;
    }

    header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .nav {
      min-height: 76px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    }

    .brand span {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .nav-label {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 90px 0 70px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--accent);
      border: 1px solid #285448;
      background: #10251f;
      padding: 6px 13px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 5rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -0.055em;
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 0 auto 22px;
    }

    h1 span {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .intro {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      min-height: 50px;
      padding: 13px 22px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .primary {
      color: #07120f;
      background: var(--accent);
    }

    .secondary {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--panel);
    }

    .manual-section {
      padding: 20px 0 85px;
    }

    .manual-card {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #131b28, #0d121c);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: clamp(25px, 5vw, 48px);
    }

    .manual-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .document-icon {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 64px;
      height: 76px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border: 1px solid #315447;
      background: #10251f;
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 1.7rem;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .muted {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .details {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .detail {
      padding: 7px 11px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: #c5cfdd;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }

    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--border);
      margin: 30px 0;
    }

    .note {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 25px 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero {
        padding: 65px 0 50px;
      }

      .manual-top {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .nav-label {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
      }

      .actions .button {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Nexora home">
        NEXORA<span>.</span>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-label">PRODUCT SUPPORT</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Official Product Documentation</div>

      <h1>
        Your Nexora.<br>
        <span>Your Guide.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="intro">
        Everything you need to understand your Nexora system,
        get started, and make the most of its features — all in one place.
      </p>

      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="product-manual.pdf"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          View Product Manual ↗
        </a>

        <a class="button secondary" href="product-manual.pdf" download>
          ↓ Download PDF
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="manual-section container">
      <div class="manual-card">
        <div class="manual-top">
          <div class="document-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</div>

          <div>
            <h2>Nexora Product Manual</h2>
            <p class="muted">
              Your reference for system components, installation,
              everyday operation, video storage, connectivity, and
              product maintenance.
            </p>

            <div class="details">
              <span class="detail">Digital Manual</span>
              <span class="detail">PDF Document</span>
              <span class="detail">Mobile Friendly</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <p class="note">
          Keep this page bookmarked for convenient access to your
          product documentation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <span>© <span id="year"></span> Nexora</span>
      <span>Sense. Understand. Act.</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent =
      new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
